# Rust
target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Node tooling -- used ONLY for KAT generation in /tmp or via NOBLE_PQ_MLKEM,
# never committed. See docs/adrs/0006-no-node-tooling-in-repo.md.
# Exception (ADR-0018): a binding crate's own manifest crates/<crate>/package.json
# is tracked; lockfiles and node_modules never are.
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
package.json
!crates/*/package.json
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
scripts/package*.json
scripts/node_modules/

# No crate-local KAT duplicates; canonical location is repo-root tests/kat/.
crates/*/tests/kat/

# Secrets / env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# OS / editor artifacts
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
.vscode/
.idea/
